<title>UK: Die Westhyp adds 500 mln marks to Jan 2003 bond. [CORRECTED 12:05 GMT]</title>
<headline>Die Westhyp adds 500 mln marks to Jan 2003 bond. [CORRECTED 12:05 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett, Bayerische Hypothekenbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTFALISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT ** 500 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    17.JAN.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.895    PAY DATE    26.FEB.97</p>
<p>(Corrects pay date from 16.FEB.97)</p>
<p> FULL FEES  27.5 BP   REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES   ** ADDS ON TO 1.0 BLN MARK BOND LAUNCHED 08.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING    FFURT     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL   DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    6 BP	SELL CONC  21.5 BP   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 3785</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
